Nothing. You're supposed to use physical weapons with your spells as
backup. And you're supposed to run away a lot to heal _and_ to restore
power points. Just don't slow down too much or you'll get nutrition
problems. By the time the big battles occur, you will be much higher level
and will probably be in possession of the eye, giving you tons of mana.
Plus, a skilled fireball is _much_ more energy efficient than forcebolt.
All within time.

>              Should I try to avoid fights as much as possible with 
> Wizards?  

Yes. Especially in the early game.

>           Or does Power/Regeneration increase that much by gaining 
> experience so that this won't be a problem later on (or might this be 
